title: "captain-skill: claude calls you captain in every reply, and warns you the moment it stops"
abstract: "A free Claude Code skill. One rule in CLAUDE.md makes Claude call you Captain in every reply; a Stop hook warns you the moment a reply comes back without it, the early sign that your rules have slipped out of focus (context rot) and it is time for a fresh chat."
